<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Sasfin half year earnings rise.</title>
<headline>Sasfin half year earnings rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended Dec 31</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     28.0	  vs 19.3</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.87	  vs 2.56</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   4.97	  vs 3.07</p>
<p>    Tax			 1.08	  vs 0.49</p>
<p>Full name: Sasfin Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE - South African financial services firm Sasfin said it was company policy to declare dividends at the year-end.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
